   * **Always Check Before Conversion:**   *Never* blindly rely on `nextInt()`.  Introduce a check *before* attempting conversion:
     ```java
     Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);
     while (true) {  // Loop for continuous input until valid
         System.out.print("Enter an integer: ");
         if (scanner.hasNextInt()) {
             int userInput = scanner.nextInt();
             // Process userInput here (you were likely aiming for this)
             break; // Exit the loop if successful
         } else {
             System.err.println("Invalid input. Please enter a whole number.");
             scanner.next(); // Consume the erroneous input to avoid hanging
         }
     }
