   - **During Development & Deployment:**  Leverage environment variables to manage sensitive data like your Facebook App Secret.  Tools like `react-native-dotenv` allow you to load these variables securely from a `.env` file during build processes.  This keeps secrets out of your main codebase and allows easy switching between development/production configurations.

3. **SDK-Managed Flow:**

